WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.007
Self-management turns an intention into a realistic sequence of actions.

00:00:04.007 --> 00:00:10.819
A useful plan identifies a deliverable, breaks it into tasks, estimates effort and includes time for review.

00:00:10.819 --> 00:00:16.830
Progress should be assessed against completed work rather than only time spent or visual activity.

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:27.418
Identify missing programs, complete and test a small batch each day, reserve Thursday for outputs and explanations, and use Friday for final checking and submission.

00:00:27.418 --> 00:00:32.020
Adjust this schedule to the actual available class time and task size.

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:35.158
Which goal is most measurable?

00:00:35.158 --> 00:00:38.580
The last goal states an observable completion criterion.
